#: scenario:first_9B1F8BB5_7AD3_47AF_B692_87373028E8E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ca7cc61348ada322c947c0eee4fdc78cd158bffaa56b207363c136badbfabe0
